em in good condition so no one gets hurt.<br><strong>Clean</strong> up the arenas before starting a new battle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/851930/extras/1a06c8065c9212d5eb437af6961e1fb5.poster.avif?t=1725191230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/851930/extras/1a06c8065c9212d5eb437af6961e1fb5.webm?t=1725191230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/851930/extras/1a06c8065c9212d5eb437af6961e1fb5.mp4?t=1725191230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Keep your Guests happy, your Workers busy and make a profit!</strong></h2>",
